# Brand Guidelines (draft)

Primary:
- Hex: #000000 (Black background)
Accent:
- Hex: #FF4D6D (Primary CTA)
Neutral:
- Hex: #BDBDBD (Muted text)
Fonts:
- Headings: Inter Black / 800
- Body: Inter / 400
Spacing:
- Base spacing: 16px
- Grid: 8px increments

Usage:
- Headline on black background using large bold type.
- CTA uses accent color and 8px radius.
- Keep imagery minimal; let the Spline 3D scene provide visual richness.
